    partName: Selut
    localPosition: {x: 0.025000006, y: 0, z: -0.021007061}
    visibleFrom: 0
    title:
      id: Selut Bertatah Permata
      en: Jewelled Selut
    regionalTerm: 'Bali: selut'
    material:
      id: 'Pada model: emas dengan ruby, zamrud, dan safir (perlu dikonfirmasi)'
      en: 'On the model: gold with ruby, emerald and sapphire (to be confirmed)'
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Cincin cawan di pangkal hulu, dihiasi dua baris butiran emas dan sepuluh
        permata cabochon berselang warna. Keris Bali memang kerap dihias emas, perak,
        dan batu mulia.
      en: The cup-shaped collar at the base of the hilt, decorated with two rows
        of gold beads and ten cabochon gems in alternating colours. Balinese keris
        are often adorned with gold, silver and precious stones.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
